### Test Roquace Backend API

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@token = your-token-here

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}

### Get All Products (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### Get Single Product (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/your-product-id

### Admin Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@roquace.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Verify Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Product (Admin Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Test Product",
  "slug": "test-product",
  "description": "Test description",
  "price": 99.99,
  "compare_price": 149.99,
  "category": "Clothing",
  "subcategory": "Shirts",
  "images": ["https://via.placeholder.com/800"],
  "colors": ["Red", "Blue"],
  "sizes": ["S", "M", "L"],
  "tags": ["test", "new"],
  "stock": 100,
  "is_featured": false,
  "is_new": true
}

### Update Product (Admin Only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/your-product-id
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "price": 79.99,
  "stock": 50
}

### Delete Product (Admin Only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/your-product-id
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
